<s2>
<ptxt>Illumination Inspection (Night Illumination)</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Check that the illumination (LED) in the steering pad switch assembly comes on when battery positive voltage is connected to terminal 5 (IL+2) and battery negative to terminal 8 (EAU).</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Comes on</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</s3>
